# Summary of Changes

✅ **CodeViewer.vue**
- Added `repoChanges` prop
- Added `applyRepoChanges()` method to extract diff data from repoChanges
- Added watcher for `repoChanges` prop
- Modified `mounted()` to use `applyRepoChanges()` when repoChanges available
- `loadDiffInfo()` is now only called as fallback

✅ **PRFile.vue**
- Added `repoChanges` prop
- Passes `repoChanges` to CodeViewer component

✅ **PRReport.vue**
- Added `repoChanges` prop
- Passes `repoChanges` to each PRFile component

✅ **PRView.vue**
- Passes `localRepoChanges` to PRReport component

This eliminates redundant API calls since diff data is already available in the repoChanges object!
